    sa "我开个玩笑都不行，你插在我里面时倒能说这种话？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:265
translate schinese ep9_sage_lewd1_label_4bbe5891:

    # mc "Sorry..."
    mc "抱歉……"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:274
translate schinese ep9_sage_lewd1_label_d433e9e9:

    # sa "What's going on?"
    sa "怎么了？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:276
translate schinese ep9_sage_lewd1_label_7a37baab:

    # mc "I'm still a bit shocked about who your family is."
    mc "我还是有点无法接受你的家人是谁。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:278
translate schinese ep9_sage_lewd1_label_853ffb42:

    # sa "So? I'm still the same I always was."
    sa "所以？我跟以前一样，还是老样子。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:280
translate schinese ep9_sage_lewd1_label_e130b7fa:

    # mc "I can't help but look at you a bit differently now."
    mc "我忍不住开始用不一样的眼光看你。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:282
translate schinese ep9_sage_lewd1_label_34c53a11:

    # sa "Talk to me... What's on your mind?"
    sa "跟我说说……你在想什么？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:289
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_6f98fcab:

    # mc "What's up with your last name? Why don't you go by Burke like your brother?"
    mc "你的姓是怎么回事？为什么你不像哥哥那样只姓Burke？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:291
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_07cd6b38:

    # sa "..."
    sa "..."

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:294
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_1c371369:

    # sa "Morgan is my given name. When Mom and Dad adopted my brother and me, they let us keep our last names and added Burke to them."
    sa "Morgan是我原本的名字。爸妈收养我和哥哥时，让我们保留原来的姓，又在后面加上了Burke。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:296
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_61ae0f50:

    # sa "Morgan is my given name. When Mom and Dad adopted my brother and me-"
    sa "Morgan是我原本的名字。爸妈收养我和哥哥时——"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:298
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_7a2ffd35:

    # mc "He's adopted too?"
    mc "他也是领养的？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:300
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_49e17407:

    # sa "Yes. We come from the same foster home."
    sa "对。我们来自同一个寄养家庭。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:301
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_46ae7987:

    # sa "My parents couldn't have kids, so they chose to adopt."
    sa "我爸妈本来不能生孩子，所以他们选择了收养。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:302
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_b50f0ef6:

    # sa "My dad wanted a son, and my mom wanted a daughter; they adopted both of us."
    sa "我爸想要个儿子，我妈想要个女儿，他们就同时收养了我们两个。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:304
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_fd5edd2a:

    # sa "They let us keep our last names and added Burke to them."
    sa "他们让我们保留原来的姓氏，然后在后面加上了Burke。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:306
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_29b1e4d5:

    # mc "Why did they do that?"
    mc "他们为什么要这么做？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:308
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_d49ecc10:

    # sa "Because adoption is a loaded subject to talk to your kids about."
    sa "因为领养是一个很复杂、很难对孩子谈起的话题。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:309
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_d4046d55:

    # sa "Keeping our last names made it easier for them to discuss it with us."
    sa "保留我们原来的姓氏让他们和我们讨论这件事要容易得多。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:311
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_557c4f33:

    # sa "When we got older, we talked about the adoption, and they asked us if we wanted to change our last names."
    sa "我们长大后聊到了收养的事，他们问我们是否想改姓。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:312
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_a7df8d98:

    # sa "My brother chose to remove his and only keep Burke, but I chose to keep mine."
    sa "我哥哥选择去掉原来的姓，只保留Burke，但我选择留下自己的。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:314
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_24807a24:

    # mc "Why did you keep yours?"
    mc "你为什么保留自己的？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:316
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_cd3a7291:

    # sa "Even though I'm grateful for what Mom and Dad have done for me, \"Morgan\" is the only thing that connects me to my birth mom and dad."
    sa "虽然我很感激爸妈为我做的一切，但‘Morgan’是我和亲生父母之间唯一的联系。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:318
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_24cc717e:

    # sa "And choosing to use \"Morgan\" is easier for me too."
    sa "而且对我来说，使用‘Morgan’也更轻松。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:319
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_ec6686ce:

    # sa "Most people know who I am and about my family, but even so, it distances me from our well-known name."
    sa "大多数人都知道我是谁，也知道我的家庭，但即便如此，这个姓还是让我和Burke那个响亮的名号保持了一点距离。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:321
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_0df6b54f:

    # sa "It gives me an identity, and I feel like I'm independent, you know?"
    sa "它给了我一个身份，让我感觉像个独立的人，你懂吧？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:322
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_ac64fbef:

    # sa "I'm not abusing the Burke name to get ahead like my brother."
    sa "我不是在利用 Burke 这个名字来谋求好处，就像我哥哥那样。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:324
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_fb76ec1f:

    # sa "Does that answer your question?"
    sa "这回答了你的问题吗？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:326
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_21065af7:

    # mc "It does... Thank you."
    mc "回答了……谢谢你。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:329
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_67de63e9:

    # sa "Is anything else on your mind?"
    sa "你心里还有别的事吗？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:333
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_1a8dfa2a:

    # mc "I can't wrap my head around that Tybalt is your brother."
    mc "我就是想不通，那个Tybalt怎么是你哥哥。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:335
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_8057ef09:

    # sa "We're not blood-related if it makes you feel any better."
    sa "如果你觉得这样好受些的话，我们其实没血缘关系。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:336
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_ccb5d978:

    # sa "And my feelings for him shouldn't be of any surprise to you."
    sa "我对他的态度，你应该一点也不意外。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:338
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_b1f5052a:

    # mc "I can't stand your brother."
    mc "我受不了你哥哥。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:340
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_5a1ea9cd:

    # sa "Me neither! Fuck him. Sometimes I wish Mom and Dad had never adopted both of us."
    sa "我也受不了！去他的。有时我真希望爸妈当初没有把我们俩都收养。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:341
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_6a236540:

    # sa "But if they hadn't, maybe I would have turned out like him. So, there's that."
    sa "可如果他们没有收养我们，也许我最后会变得和他一样。所以也只能这么想了。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:344
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_7a2ffd35_1:

    # mc "He's adopted too?"
    mc "他也是领养的？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:346
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_49e17407_1:

    # sa "Yes. We come from the same foster home."
    sa "对。我们来自同一个寄养家庭。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:347
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_46ae7987_1:

    # sa "My parents couldn't have kids, so they chose to adopt."
    sa "我爸妈本来不能生孩子，所以他们选择了收养。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:348
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_b50f0ef6_1:

    # sa "My dad wanted a son, and my mom wanted a daughter; they adopted both of us."
    sa "我爸想要个儿子，我妈想要个女儿，所以他们收养了我们两个。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:350
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_cd24b10a:

    # sa "I know you don't get along with Tybalt, but you don't have to worry about him. Trust me."
    sa "我知道你跟Tybalt关系不好，但你不用担心他。相信我。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:355
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_68d94a8a:

    # mc "So... Your mom's been my teacher."
    mc "所以……你妈妈一直是我的老师。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:357
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_13c51943:

    # sa "Yeah. Why were you taking Gender Studies?"
    sa "对。你为什么会选性别研究？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:359
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_93795e2b:

    # mc "It was a mistake. Maya told me it was easy credits and would look good on my resume."
    mc "这是个错误。Maya跟我说这门课很容易拿学分，对简历也好看。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:361
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_f426f9b9:

    # sa "She's not wrong about that last part, you know."
    sa "至少她说对简历有好处，这点没错。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:363
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_21daa5b5:

    # mc "I was getting at that she's different from you in many ways."
    mc "我是想说，她在很多方面都和你不同。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:365
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_b2a87f47:

    # sa "She is stern, but she has softer sides too. Sadly, as a female professor, you have to be strict to get respect."
    sa "她是很严厉，但也有温柔的一面。可惜女教授必须表现得强硬，才能赢得尊重。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:367
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_6cb67b51:

    # mc "(I wanna ask more about her, but I probably shouldn't...)"
    mc "（我还想多问些她的事，但最好还是别问……）"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:372
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_5f57a498:

    # mc "Tell me more about your dad."
    mc "跟我说说你爸。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:374
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_b4adcbac:

    # sa "Um... Ok? He's an honorary professor of the economics department."
    sa "嗯……好吧？他是经济系的名誉教授。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:375
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_6252d6db:

    # sa "He teaches several classes, too. He's a student counselor and, as you now know, a major cog in granting scholarships."
    sa "他还教好几门课，也是学生顾问。现在你也知道了，奖学金能不能批下来，他的话相当关键。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:376
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_d8571163:

    # sa "He used to be a successful investment banker, but he got fired for some bullshit reason."
    sa "他以前是个成功的投资银行家，后来因为某个狗屁理由被开除了。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:378
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_58051065:

    # sa "It didn't matter, though. He had already made bank before he left."
    sa "不过这已经不重要了，他离开前早就赚够了钱。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:379
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_d6898451:

    # sa "He's got plenty of contacts, which he uses today to procure funding and donations for the school."
    sa "他人脉很广，如今就用这些关系替学校争取资金和捐款。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:380
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_04a1dae4:

    # sa "B&R loves him for it."
    sa "B&R也因此很器重他。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:382
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_e2277170:

    # mc "That's quite a list of accomplishments... How is he as a dad?"
    mc "那可真是不少成就……他当爹怎么样？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:384
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_66487656:

    # sa "Um... He's smart, and he's taught me a lot in life. He's my role model and the reason why I'm studying economics."
    sa "嗯……他很聪明，也教会了我许多人生道理。他是我的榜样，也是我选择经济学的原因。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:386
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_7148d189:

    # mc "And as a dad...?"
    mc "那作为父亲呢……？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:388
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_49a68ce6:

    # sa "Look. He's there for me in his own way. No parent is perfect."
    sa "听着，他会用自己的方式支持我。没有哪个父母是完美的。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:389
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_89c1edea:

    # sa "He's not exactly the most...um..."
    sa "他不算是那种最……呃……"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:391
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_9381c59a:

    # sa "As I told you in the past, we're not good at talking about emotions."
    sa "就像我之前告诉过你的，我们不擅长谈论感情。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:392
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_52236854:

    # sa "I wish it were different, but it is what it is."
    sa "我希望情况能有所不同，但事实就是这样。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:396
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_b252f76d:

    # sa "Was that everything you wanted to know?"
    sa "你想知道的都问完了吗？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:398
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_a4dcf42c:

    # mc "Your answers helped a lot, yeah."
    mc "嗯，你的回答让我想通了很多。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:400
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_a50a061b:

    # sa "It's nice that you want to get to know me better. I want to tell you about myself, but you know it's tough for me to open up about these things."
    sa "你愿意多了解我，我很开心。我也想把自己的事告诉你，但你知道，要对这些事敞开心扉对我很难。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:402
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_78d1dcdf:

    # mc "I know..."
    mc "我知道……"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:404
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_f82377e1:

    # sa "But I don't like how you had to ask me during sex."
    sa "但我不喜欢你偏偏在做爱时问我。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:406
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_038df6db:

    # mc "Sorry... It's been stuck in my mind lately. I couldn't focus."
    mc "抱歉……最近这事一直堵在我心里，让我没法专心。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:408
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_3c5b239a:

    # sa "Are you good?"
    sa "你没事吧？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:410
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_a79900f9:

    # mc "Yeah, I am. Actually, it's kind of nice..."
    mc "嗯，我挺好的。其实还挺不错的……"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:412
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_50637856:

    # mc "There's one thing that we have in common. Neither of us knew our mother."
    mc "我们有一个共同点：我们都不认识自己的亲生母亲。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:414
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_8db7b496:

    # sa "I guess that's right."
    sa "我想应该是这样。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:416
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_d67e4884:

    # mc "I've been reading my mom's diary to get to know her, and it's pretty insightful..."
    mc "我一直在读我妈妈的日记，想了解她，挺有启发的……"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:417
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_1183ae17:

    # mc "I've learned a lot about her even though I never met her."
    mc "我虽然从来没见着她，但也从她的日记里了解了很多关于她的事情。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:418
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_ad895a9c:

    # mc "Did you ever look into who your mom was?"
    mc "你有没有调查过自己的亲生母亲是谁？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:420
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_07cd6b38_1:

    # sa "..."
    sa "..."

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:421
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_05500ff6:

    # mc "Huh?"
    mc "嗯？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:423
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_23cffb3e:

    # sa "Put your clothes on; I'm not horny anymore."
    sa "把衣服穿上，我已经没兴致了。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:425
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_0f0efafc:

    # mc "What's wrong? Was it something I said?"
    mc "怎么了？我哪里说错了吗？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:427
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_97de711a:

    # sa "Uh! What's wrong? You're asking me all these serious questions as if they don't mean anything."
    sa "哈！怎么了？你把这些严肃的问题随口问出来，好像它们无关紧要一样。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:429
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_36c94909:

    # mc "I'm sorry. I'm only trying to bond and understand you better."
    mc "对不起。我只是想和你拉近关系，更了解你。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:432
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_43a44aad:

    # sa "Talking about my family during sex. God, you're such a boner-killer!"
    sa "做爱时聊我的家庭。天啊，你真是个让人软掉的扫兴鬼！"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:434
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:439
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_f9837077:

    # mc "Sometimes it feels like I'm traversing a minefield when I ask her stuff."
    mc "有时向她问些事情，感觉就像在穿越雷区。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:441
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_498b42f5:

    # de "She hits you?"
    de "她打你了？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:443
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_98075625:

    # mc "No, but she is quick to anger, mostly when I ask her private questions."
    mc "不，但她很容易生气，尤其是当我问她私密问题的时候。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:444
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_7b7cec23:

    # mc "She calms down fast, though."
    mc "她很快就会冷静下来。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:446
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_a9b43c0d:

    # de "Maybe she doesn't like you prying?"
    de "也许她不喜欢你这么打听？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_sage_branch.rpy:448
translate schinese ep9_sage_q_label_7c705e20:

    # mc "It's not prying; it's called getting to know each other."
    mc "这不是打探，这是互相了解。"

